            "review_text": "Graeme H\n4 contributions\n0\nMemorable Meal\nJul 2025 • Family\nGreat family meal, you'll have to book ahead or line up because its that good! We were happy to wait 30 minutes (not my normal thing to do!) Our table manager Hoa was kind and considerate. He will show you how best to prepare the meals, rice paper Wraps etc... great value, great flavours, memorable meal!\nInsider tip:\nAsk the staff to help you choose a new dining experience\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 16, 2025",
